  <XDFCONSTANT uniqueid="0x203D" flags="0x0">
    <title>Program in the left gate when [0xFFFF918C] != 2, factory 0x0B = PB (0x70966)</title>
    <description>Code 0x0B (PB, matrix k10, M) is set as soon as the lever is in the gate, without +/-. 19D0 pair 0x8975: BMW 19C0 and BMW 15C0 have 0xFE (the gate gives S until the first +/- tap), Alpina 19D0 620P has 0x0B like this file. Patch gate:mode=S writes 0xFE (document 13).</description>
