    <description>[0xFFFF918C] = bits 0-1 of byte 2 of CAN 0x338. Code 3 = P3 (S, k15) until the first +/- tap, then M (latch [0xFFFF9112]); the AGS points stay at or above [0x70892] = 193. Meaning of value 2 not established.</description>
