    <title>Kick-down: source, 1 = DME2 bit over CAN ([0xFFFF90BA]), 0 = pedal switch and pedal above 0x70232, factory 1 (0x70D6A)</title>
    <description>0x1BCA4: not 0 -&gt; kick-down flag [0xFFFF90B7] = [0xFFFF90BA] (bit 2 of byte 6 of DME2); 0 -&gt; switch on bit 7 of port [0xFFFF8A0A] (active low, filtered over [0x70ED6] samples) and pedal above [0x70232]. With the flag the matrices use pedal 255 (0x206F8), AGS is not updated (0x1908C) and the manual M branch is skipped (0x2047E): in M +/- do not work with the pedal floored. 19D0 pair 0x8D1A (E39 = 0, switch). Kick-down off: 0 here and 255 in 0x70232 (patch no-kickdown, document 13).</description>
    <CATEGORYMEM index="0" category="14" />
    <EMBEDDEDDATA mmedtypeflags="0x00" mmedaddress="0x70D6A" mmedelementsizebits="8" mmedmajorstridebits="0" mmedminorstridebits="0" />
