  <XDFCONSTANT uniqueid="0x26F2" flags="0x0">
    <title>Kick-down: pedal threshold of the switch path, factory 230 (0x70232)</title>
    <description>0x1BD82 (the only reference): pedal above the byte and the switch -&gt; kick-down; used only with [0x70D6A] = 0. The gearbox pedal is at most 254, so 255 = never. 19D0 pair 0x8246.</description>
